{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352560/extras/story.png?t=1748463078\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;In the lonely wasteland that leads to a mining site, someone dumps the body of a woman and a series of horrible clues with the cryptic message of her killer at night. Who is hiding to commit such atrocities and why? Nicolas, the young owner of Bar Delirio, has decided to discover the murderer to protect the life of the only family he has left: his little niece. But he won't be alone. If he trust the right person, he might find more than just the truth. Maybe he will end up discovering his true desires in the Delirium.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Romance and thriller Visual Novel in English and Spanish.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352560/extras/features.png?t=1748463078\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting recipes for Bar Delirio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Aguasvivas Town with map events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect mysteries and solve the case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 unique characters to choose a romance. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings based in your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352560/extras/about_demo.png?t=1748463078\" />Night in Delirium is being\u00a0developed with Ren'Py. Currently it has a demo available with a tutorial and two chapters of the story. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352560?t=1748463078","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352560?t=1748463078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams